WEBVTT

00:15:59.204 --> 00:16:00.372
not just one or two,

00:16:00.414 --> 00:16:03.166
so that women are not sitting
on top of each other's laps,

00:16:03.208 --> 00:16:04.710
fighting for one meal.

00:16:05.293 --> 00:16:09.047
We already know that more
diverse teams perform better.

00:16:09.423 --> 00:16:10.841
A recent study shows

00:16:10.882 --> 00:16:13.218
that corporations that have
more gender diversity

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.678
on their executive teams,

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:19.349
were 25 percent more likely
to experience above average profitability.

00:16:19.349 --> 00:16:22.769
And more racially diverse companies
had 36 percent more profit.

00:16:22.811 --> 00:16:24.730
So really, no matter how you look at it,

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.774
it's time to build
longer tables and more seats.

00:16:28.483 --> 00:16:30.652
And I want to say something,